{"unit_id":"mio-4396__dsh-message-rewind#card-zh","repo":"mio-4396/dsh-message-rewind","commit":"d2e96998697470839afd15dc0cd4c887e9d9d9b3","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-message-rewind 是面向 DSH 网页端的消息撤回插件。在自己发出的消息旁提供撤回入口，点击后通过 Host 路由停止该会话正在生成的回答，并尝试把原消息文本恢复到输入框；如果草稿恢复失败，会尝试复制文本到剪贴板。插件会为消息显示已撤回标记，并在撤回后短暂调整回合结束提示。它适合想修正刚发出的提示并重新编辑的 DSH 网页用户。撤回不会删除原会话记录，图片和文件也不会恢复。无需 API 密钥或外部服务。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:28-83","src/client.js:351-384","src/client.js:623-634","src/client.js:881-930"]}
{"unit_id":"mio-4396__dsh-message-rewind#card-en","repo":"mio-4396/dsh-message-rewind","commit":"d2e96998697470839afd15dc0cd4c887e9d9d9b3","type":"card","lang":"en","text":"dsh-message-rewind adds a withdrawal action to DSH web. It stops the running answer and restores sent text to the composer, with clipboard fallback. The row is marked withdrawn, but the session record remains and attachments are not restored. No API key or external service is needed.","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.js:28-83","src/client.js:351-384","src/client.js:623-634","src/client.js:881-930"]}
